nt after these teenagers  attitude and they have so much attitude  reject the idea of becoming Power  Rangers they're defeated by putties so  coming in at number 2 it's the Power  Rangers more for the very first time  what did we do now Thorin said these  poem work was to give us power let's do  it  [Music]  Triceratops or  now what could be the most iconic moment  from Mighty Morphin Power Rangers well  we talked a lot about Tommy Oliver but  of course he was defeated and he lost  all his powers and the gang was in need  of a replacement at this point they know  they're getting a new ranger but who is  it this is moment number one the White  Ranger welcome White Ranger the time has  come to reveal your identity  [Music]  guess who's back so yeah I don't know if  you can argue that another moment tops  that one but maybe you have some  opinions about the way things were  ordered or maybe a moment I didn't even  mention that you're kind of freaking out  at me over let me know on Twitter or of  course leave a comment in the comment  section we have one of those thanks so  much for watching keep Morphin  [Music]  you  [Music]

